{"id":80,"title":"സംസ്ഥാനത്ത് അതിതീവ്ര മഴ; ഏഴ് ജില്ലകളിൽ ഓറഞ്ച് അലർട്ട്","subheadline":"തീരദേശ, മലയോര മേഖലകളിൽ ജാഗ്രത പാലിക്കാൻ ദുരന്ത നിവാരണ അതോറിറ്റിയുടെ നിർദേശം","url":"/kerala-news/samsthanatt-atitivra-mazha-ezh-jillakalil-oranch-alartt","full_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/kerala-news/samsthanatt-atitivra-mazha-ezh-jillakalil-oranch-alartt","image":{"id":94,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-18.2e16d0ba.fill-400x225.format-webp.webp","width":400,"height":225},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-18.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"primary_category":{"id":3,"name":"Keralam News","slug":"kerala-news","colour":"#2E7D32","url":"/kerala-news"},"reporter":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:52:39.888000+05:30","last_major_update_at":null,"reading_time":1,"language":"ml","flags":{"is_breaking":false,"is_premium":false,"has_video":false},"hero_image":{"id":94,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"hero":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-18.2e16d0ba.fill-1600x900.format-webp.webp","width":1600,"height":900},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-18.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"featured_image_caption":"","featured_image_credit":"Paul Jarvis (Picsum #18)","body":[{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p data-block-key=\"d3jz5\">സംസ്ഥാനത്ത് അടുത്ത മൂന്ന് ദിവസം അതിതീവ്ര മഴയ്ക്ക് സാധ്യതയുണ്ടെന്ന് കാലാവസ്ഥാ വകുപ്പ് മുന്നറിയിപ്പ് നൽകി. ഏഴ് ജില്ലകളിൽ ഓറഞ്ച് അലർട്ട് പ്രഖ്യാപിച്ചിട്ടുണ്ട്.</p>","id":"474a5a52-c12c-45e5-8098-d300fc583ac4"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p data-block-key=\"nqzjn\">തീരദേശ മേഖലകളിലും മലയോര പ്രദേശങ്ങളിലും താമസിക്കുന്നവർ ജാഗ്രത പാലിക്കണമെന്ന് ദുരന്ത നിവാരണ അതോറിറ്റി അറിയിച്ചു. മത്സ്യത്തൊഴിലാളികൾ കടലിൽ പോകരുതെന്നും നിർദേശമുണ്ട്.</p>","id":"e4e235c1-46a1-49e4-98f9-0feca3cd02f1"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p data-block-key=\"ytbbu\">ആവശ്യമെങ്കിൽ ദുരിതാശ്വാസ ക്യാമ്പുകൾ തുറക്കാൻ ജില്ലാ ഭരണകൂടങ്ങൾക്ക് നിർദേശം നൽകിയിട്ടുണ്ട്. അടിയന്തര സാഹചര്യങ്ങളിൽ കൺട്രോൾ റൂമുമായി ബന്ധപ്പെടാം.</p>","id":"51cf5c2e-64bf-422d-afa7-63ce03685a47"}],"live_updates":[],"corrections":[],"reporter_profile":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair","designation":"Correspondent","beat":"Sports and Business, Kochi","bio":"Rahul reports on sports and business from Kochi, with a focus on football and start-ups.","photo":null,"social":{"x":null,"facebook":null,"instagram":null,"linkedin":null}},"categories":[{"id":3,"name":"Keralam News","slug":"kerala-news","colour":"#2E7D32","url":"/kerala-news"}],"tags":[{"name":"kerala-news","slug":"kerala-news","url":"/tag/kerala-news"}],"location":"","district":"","is_featured":true,"is_editors_pick":false,"is_premium":false,"premium_gate_ready":false,"allow_ads":true,"word_count":44,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:32:07.180176+05:30","breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Home","url":"/"},{"name":"Keralam News","url":"/kerala-news"},{"name":"സംസ്ഥാനത്ത് അതിതീവ്ര മഴ; ഏഴ് ജില്ലകളിൽ ഓറഞ്ച് അലർട്ട്","url":"/kerala-news/samsthanatt-atitivra-mazha-ezh-jillakalil-oranch-alartt"}],"seo":{"title":"സംസ്ഥാനത്ത് അതിതീവ്ര മഴ; ഏഴ് ജില്ലകളിൽ ഓറഞ്ച് അലർട്ട്","description":"തീരദേശ, മലയോര മേഖലകളിൽ ജാഗ്രത പാലിക്കാൻ ദുരന്ത നിവാരണ അതോറിറ്റിയുടെ നിർദേശം","og_image":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-_QdwGPv4.2e16d0ba.fill-1200x630.format-jpeg.jpegquality-85.jpg","canonical_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/kerala-news/samsthanatt-atitivra-mazha-ezh-jillakalil-oranch-alartt","noindex":false,"published_time":"2026-11-17T16:52:39.888000+05:30","modified_time":"2026-11-19T09:32:07.180176+05:30"},"alternate_version":null,"related":[{"id":91,"title":"Road widening work begins in Kochi","subheadline":"Officials said the work would be completed in phases so that residents face as little disruption as possible","url":"/kerala-news/road-widening-work-begins-in-kochi","full_url":"__PR